m="translate(188 276)"><g class="k"><text class="o" x="0" y="5.1" text-anchor="middle">Atlantic Ocean</text></g></g><g transform="translate(117.1 242.4)"><g class="k"><path d="M-10.7 -8H10.7V1.2C10.7 6.4 4.8 8 0 9.6C-4.8 8 -10.7 6.4 -10.7 1.2z" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#1c2028" stroke-width="1.1"/><text class="r" y="3.1" text-anchor="middle">17</text></g></g><g transform="translate(135.4 128.6)"><g class="k"><rect x="-10.7" y="-8" width="21.5" height="16" rx="3" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#1c2028" stroke-width="1.1"/><text class="r" y="4" text-anchor="middle">31</text></g></g><g transform="translate(131.5 105)"><g class="k"><rect x="-12" y="-8" width="23.9" height="16" rx="3" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#1c2028" stroke-width="1.1"/><text class="r" y="4" text-anchor="middle">90</text></g></g><g transform="translate(269.2 121.1)"><g class="k"><rect x="-9.5" y="-8" width="19" height="16" rx="3" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#1c2028" stroke-width="1.1"/><text class="r" y="4" text-anchor="middle">9</text></g></g><g><g transform="translate(156.6 242.5)"><g class="k"><circle r="11" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#91592b" stroke-width="1.6"/><use href="#c3r-del-webb-north-myrtle-be-beach" x="-7.4" y="-7.4" width="14.7" height="14.7" color="#1c2028"/><text class="l" x="15" y="-3"><tspan x="15">Beach</tspan></text><text class="m" x="15" y="12.5">about 4 min</text></g></g><g transform="translate(239.7 59.9)"><g class="k"><circle r="11" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#91592b" stroke-width="1.6"/><use href="#c3r-del-webb-north-myrtle-be-hospital" x="-7.4" y="-7.4" width="14.7" height="14.7" color="#1c2028"/><text class="l" x="15" y="-3"><tspan x="15">Hospital</tspan></text><text class="m" x="15" y="12.5">about 10 min</text></g></g><g transform="translate(194.1 189.7)"><g class="k"><circle r="11" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#91592b" stroke-width="1.6"/><use href="#c3r-del-webb-north-myrtle-be-grocery" x="-7.4" y="-7.4" width="14.7" height="14.7" color="#1c2028"/><text class="l" x="15" y="-3"><tspan x="15">Kroger</tspan></text><text class="m" x="15" y="12.5">about 6 min</text></g></g><g transform="translate(137.3 194.1)"><g class="k"><g transform="scale(0.8)"><ellipse cx="0" cy="1" rx="7" ry="2.4" fill="#1c2028" opacity=".18"/><path d="M0 0C-3-6-13-14-13-26a13 13 0 1 1 26 0c0 12-10 20-13 26z" fill="#c4783a" stroke="#1c2028" stroke-width="1.5"/><use href="#c3r-del-webb-north-myrtle-be-home" x="-8.5" y="-34.5" width="17" height="17" color="#ffffff"/></g><text class="h" x="-15" y="-14.5" text-anchor="end"><tspan x="-15">Del Webb</tspan></text></g></g></g></svg><figcaption style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:.6rem">Map of where Del Webb North Myrtle Beach is, with drive times by car. Map data: U.S. Census Bureau TIGER/Line; Horry County GIS.</figcaption></figure><p class="c3-map-links" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;margin:.6rem 0 1.6rem;max-width:760px;font-size:.95rem"><span style="color:var(--brass-ink);display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5a7 7 0 0 1 14 0C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg></span><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=33.821769,-78.700908" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Del Webb North Myrtle Beach in Google Maps</a></p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">For an emergency, the North Strand emergency room is closer than the hospital, about 5 minutes by car. It is open day and night.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="what-is-north-myrtle-beach-like"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="The town">What is North Myrtle Beach like?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">North Myrtle Beach has a wide sand beach lined with beach houses. The city keeps hundreds of paths to the beach and dozens of public parking lots, so you can find a place near the sand.</p><div class="c3-aerial c3-aerial-close"><figure class="c3ph-hero" style=""><div class="c3ph-f"><img src="/images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/north-myrtle-beach-beach-umbrellas-1200w.webp" srcset="/images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/north-myrtle-beach-beach-umbrellas-600w.webp 600w, /images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/north-myrtle-beach-beach-umbrellas-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1136px" width="1200" height="800" alt="Rows of beach chairs and blue, green and yellow umbrellas on the wide sand beach in North Myrtle Beach" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="c3ph-cr"><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Photo: JefferyGoldman. License: CC BY-SA 4.0" title="License: CC BY-SA 4.0">Photo: JefferyGoldman</a></span></div><figcaption>Beach chairs and umbrellas on the beach in North Myrtle Beach.</figcaption></figure></div><ul role="list" style="list-style:none;margin:1.2rem 0 1.6rem;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(18rem,1fr));gap:.75rem;max-width:760px"><li style="background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);padding:.9rem .85rem 1rem;margin:0"><span style="display:flex;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--brass-ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:.6rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 9.4c-.4-1-1.5-1.8-3-1.8-1.8 0-3 1-3 2.2 0 3 6 1.6 6 4.4 0 1.3-1.3 2.2-3 2.2-1.6 0-2.7-.7-3.1-1.8M12 5.8v1.8M12 16.4v1.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg></span><strong style="display:block;color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:.25rem">Beach parking</strong><span style="display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5">Free early in the morning, in the evening and all winter.</span></li><li style="background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);padding:.9rem .85rem 1rem;margin:0"><span style="display:flex;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--brass-ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:.6rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 4h12M6 4v8M14 4v8M5 17.5H3V12h12l3-4h1.5L21 13v4.5h-2M9 17.5h6"/><circle cx="7" cy="17.5" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="2"/></svg></span><strong style="display:block;color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:.25rem">Golf carts</strong><span style="display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5">Allowed with a state permit sticker, on roads of 35 mph or less, from sunrise to sunset.</span></li><li style="background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);padding:.9rem .85rem 1rem;margin:0"><span style="display:flex;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--brass-ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:.6rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 13c-2.5 0-5 2.6-5 5 0 1.6 1.2 2.5 2.6 2.5.9 0 1.6-.5 2.4-.5s1.5.5 2.4.5c1.4 0 2.6-.9 2.6-2.5 0-2.4-2.5-5-5-5z"/><circle cx="5.3" cy="11" r="1.8"/><circle cx="9" cy="6.3" r="1.8"/><circle cx="15" cy="6.3" r="1.8"/><circle cx="18.7" cy="11" r="1.8"/></svg></span><strong style="display:block;color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:.25rem">Dogs on the beach</strong><span style="display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5">Always on a leash. From mid-May to Labor Day, no dogs on the beach from 10 a.m. to 4 p.m.</span></li></ul><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">To reach the nearest city beach parking lot, you drive a short way along US 17. Golf carts may only cross US 17, so plan to take your car to the beach.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">These places in town are close by car.</p><ul role="list" style="list-style:none;margin:1.2rem 0 1.6rem;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(9rem,1fr));gap:.75rem;max-width:760px"><li style="background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);padding:.9rem .85rem 1rem;margin:0"><span style="display:flex;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--brass-ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:.6rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5.6 5.6c3.5 3.5 3.5 9.3 0 12.8M18.4 5.6c-3.5 3.5-3.5 9.3 0 12.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg></span><strong style="display:block;color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:.25rem">Central Park</strong><span style="display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5">A city park with a paved walking path and tennis courts. About 2 minutes.</span></li><li style="background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);padding:.9rem .85rem 1rem;margin:0"><span style="display:flex;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--brass-ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:.6rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12.6 7.6 11 14l-2.6 7M11 14l3.4 3 .6 4M12.4 9l-3.4 2.6M12.4 9l3 2.6 2.6.4"/><circle cx="13.4" cy="4.4" r="2"/></svg></span><strong style="display:block;color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:.25rem">Ingram Dunes</strong><span style="display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5">A city trail through an old seaside forest with tall dunes. About 4 minutes.</span></li><li style="background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);padding:.9rem .85rem 1rem;margin:0"><span style="display:flex;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--brass-ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:.6rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V9.5l5-3V21M10 21V4h9v17M13 8h3M13 12h3M13 16h3M7.5 13h.01M7.5 16.5h.01"/></svg></span><strong style="display:block;color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:.25rem">Main Street</strong><span style="display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5">Shops, places to eat and free concerts on summer Thursdays. About 7 minutes.</span></li><li style="background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);padding:.9rem .85rem 1rem;margin:0"><span style="display:flex;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--brass-ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:.6rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 8h12l-1 12.1a1 1 0 0 1-1 .9H8a1 1 0 0 1-1-.9zM9 10V6.5a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V10"/></svg></span><strong style="display:block;color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:.25rem">Barefoot Landing</strong><span style="display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5">Dozens of shops and restaurants by the Intracoastal Waterway. About 10 minutes.</span></li><li style="background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);padding:.9rem .85rem 1rem;margin:0"><span style="display:flex;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--brass-ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:.6rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2 9.5c2.6-3.3 7.4-4 11 0-3.6 4-8.4 3.3-11 0zM13 9.5l5-3.5v7zM5.5 9h.01M2 17c1.7 1.2 3.3 1.2 5 0s3.3-1.2 5 0 3.3 1.2 5 0 3.3-1.2 5 0M2 20.5c1.7 1.2 3.3 1.2 5 0s3.3-1.2 5 0 3.3 1.2 5 0 3.3-1.2 5 0"/></svg></span><strong style="display:block;color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:.25rem">Cherry Grove Pier</strong><span style="display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5">Walk out over the ocean or fish from it. About 15 minutes.</span></li><li style="background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);padding:.9rem .85rem 1rem;margin:0"><span style="display:flex;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--brass-ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:.6rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3v13M12 3l7 11h-7M10 6l-5 8h5M3 16h18l-2 4H5z"/></svg></span><strong style="display:block;color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:.25rem">Heritage Shores</strong><span style="display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5">City boardwalks and docks over the salt marsh. About 20 minutes.</span></li></ul><div class="c3-aerial c3-aerial-close"><figure class="c3ph-hero" style=""><div class="c3ph-f"><img src="/images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/cherry-grove-pier-from-the-ocean-1200w.webp" srcset="/images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/cherry-grove-pier-from-the-ocean-600w.webp 600w, /images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/cherry-grove-pier-from-the-ocean-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1136px" width="1200" height="675" alt="The long wooden Cherry Grove Pier reaching into the ocean in North Myrtle Beach, with beach houses, a water tower and a tall hotel behind it" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="c3ph-cr"><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-user-w" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Photo: Festiva76. License: Public domain" title="License: Public domain">Photo: Festiva76</a></span></div><figcaption>The Cherry Grove Pier, seen from the ocean.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="what-does-a-home-in-del-webb-north-myrtle-beach-cost"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Costs">What does a home in Del Webb North Myrtle Beach cost?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">In the last year, new homes from the builder in Del Webb North Myrtle Beach usually sold for about $635,000. Homes resold by their owners sold for about $535,000.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The homeowners association (HOA) fee is about $315 a month, and it includes lawn care, internet and a TV package.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">If you live in a new home at that price, the property tax is a little under $3,000 a year, city tax included. See <a href="/buyers/property-taxes/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">how a home you live in is taxed in North Myrtle Beach</a>.</p><div style="border-left:3px solid var(--brass);background:var(--ivory);padding:1.2rem 1.4rem;margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:720px"><p style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.4rem">Get the list of Del Webb North Myrtle Beach homes for sale.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.8rem">Tell us what you are looking for, and one of our agents will send you the homes for sale now.</p><a class="btn btn-brass" href="/contact/">Get the list</a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="do-you-need-flood-insurance-in-del-webb-north-myrtle-beach"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Flood insurance">Do you need flood insurance in Del Webb North Myrtle Beach?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">You probably will not need flood insurance in Del Webb North Myrtle Beach, because every lot is outside the high-risk flood zone on <a href="https://msc.fema.gov/portal/search?AddressQuery=1285%20Possum%20Trot%20Road%2C%20North%20Myrtle%20Beach%2C%20SC%2029582" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">the government's flood map</a>. If you want a policy, it usually costs about $600 a year.</p><div style="border-left:3px solid var(--brass);background:var(--ivory-2);padding:1.2rem 1.4rem;margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:720px"><p style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.4rem">Get an insurance quote on the home you like.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.8rem">Pick the home you like. One of our agents helps you get a homeowners and flood <a href="/buyers/coastal-insurance/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">insurance</a> quote on it before you sign.</p><a class="btn btn-brass" href="/contact/">Get a quote</a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="how-does-del-webb-north-myrtle-beach-compare-with-other-55"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Compare">How does Del Webb North Myrtle Beach compare with other 55+ neighborhoods?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Del Webb North Myrtle Beach is the newest of these four 55+ neighborhoods.</p><style>.c3-cmp tr.c3-self td{background:#fff;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy)!important}@media (max-width:599px){.c3-cmp tr.c3-self{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--brass)}.c3-cmp tr.c3-self td{background:transparent}}@media (max-width:599px){.c3-cmp table,.c3-cmp tbody,.c3-cmp tr,.c3-cmp td{display:block;width:100%}.c3-cmp thead{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0)}.c3-cmp tr{background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);margin:0 0 .75rem;padding:.4rem 0}.c3-cmp td{border:0!important;padding:.25rem .9rem!important}.c3-cmp td:first-child{color:var(--navy)!important;font-weight:500;font-size:1rem}.c3-cmp td[data-label]:not(:first-child)::before{content:attr(data-label) ": ";color:var(--navy)}.c3-cmp td a{padding:11px 0}}</style><div class="c3-cmp" style=