"},"representativeOfPage":true}]}</script></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Buying on the Grand Strand?</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">Tell us about the house. Before you offer, we can price the tax at both rates, test the flood map and the wind line, look up the zoning and read the HOA papers.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Send us the house you like</a></div></section></main>
