use</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dccf);vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><a href="#litchfield-by-the-sea" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em">16. Litchfield by the Sea</a></td><td style="padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dccf);vertical-align:top;text-align:left" data-l="Homes sell for">About $200,000 for a one-bedroom condo to $2.2 million</td><td style="padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dccf);vertical-align:top;text-align:left" data-l="HOA fee a month">About $520 to $1,880</td><td style="padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dccf);vertical-align:top;text-align:left" data-l="Gate">Guard, around the clock</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dccf);vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><a href="#heritage-plantation" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em">17. Heritage Plantation</a></td><td style="padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dccf);vertical-align:top;text-align:left" data-l="Homes sell for">About $710,000</td><td style="padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dccf);vertical-align:top;text-align:left" data-l="HOA fee a month">About $325</td><td style="padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dccf);vertical-align:top;text-align:left" data-l="Gate">24-hour security</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dccf);vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><a href="#debordieu-colony" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em">18. DeBordieu Colony</a></td><td style="padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dccf);vertical-align:top;text-align:left" data-l="Homes sell for">About $2 million</td><td style="padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dccf);vertical-align:top;text-align:left" data-l="HOA fee a month">About $300 to $400</td><td style="padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3dccf);vertical-align:top;text-align:left" data-l="Gate">Guest passes</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">For neighborhoods without a gate, see <a href="/buyers/best-neighborhoods/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">the best neighborhoods in Myrtle Beach</a>, <a href="/buyers/no-hoa-homes/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">homes with no HOA</a>, <a href="/buyers/golf-communities/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">golf communities</a> and <a href="/buyers/55-plus-communities/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">55+ communities</a>.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="pros-and-cons"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Pros and cons">What are the pros and cons of a gated community?</h2><style>.c3-pc{display:grid;gap:1rem;max-width:960px;margin:1.2rem 0 1.6rem}@media (min-width:760px){.c3-pc{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:start}}.c3-pc>div{padding:1.1rem 1.2rem .6rem}.c3-pc h3{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 .8rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem}.c3-pc,.c3-pc ul{font-size:1em}.c3-pc ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.c3-pc li{display:flex;gap:.7rem;align-items:flex-start;color:var(--muted);font-size:var(--read,1.0625rem);line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 .9rem}.c3-pc li svg{flex:none;margin-top:.3rem}.c3-pc .c3-pc-do{display:block;color:var(--navy);font-weight:500;margin-top:.2rem}</style><div class="c3-pc"><div style="background:var(--ivory);border-top:3px solid var(--brass)"><h3>Pros</h3><ul><li><svg aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="var(--brass)"/><path d="M6.2 11.4l3.1 3.1 6.5-6.7" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>Most of these neighborhoods are built around something you use: a golf course, a marina, a boat ramp or a beach club.</span></li><li><svg aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="var(--brass)"/><path d="M6.2 11.4l3.1 3.1 6.5-6.7" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>Some HOA fees cover more than the gate, such as security, cable or internet.</span></li><li><svg aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="11" fill="var(--brass)"/><path d="M6.2 11.4l3.1 3.1 6.5-6.7" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>Some gates have a guard on duty day and night; others have a gatehouse or a watch desk.</span></li></ul></div><div style="background:var(--ivory);border-top:3px solid var(--muted)"><h3>Cons</h3><ul><li><svg aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="10" fill="none" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M6.8 11h8.4" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span>Every guest, contractor and delivery has to get through the gate, so a party or a repair takes some planning.</span></li><li><svg aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="10" fill="none" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M6.8 11h8.4" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span>Only two of the 18 are on the ocean, so from most of them a beach day starts in the car.</span></li><li><svg aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="10" fill="none" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M6.8 11h8.4" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span>Owners pay for big projects through their association. Outside city limits in Horry County the HOA, not the county, maintains the <a href="https://library.municode.com/sc/horry_county/codes/code_of_ordinances?nodeId=COOR_CH18LADERE" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">private streets</a>, and DeBordieu's owners pay assessments to rebuild their beach. <span class="c3-pc-do">Our agents check for <a href="/hoa/special-assessments/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">special assessments</a> before you make an offer.</span></span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="gated-communities-faq"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">Common questions</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3">Gated communities FAQ</h2><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">Does a gate make a neighborhood safer?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">We do not rate any neighborhood as safe or unsafe. The price table shows which gates have a guard, a gatehouse, a keypad or a call box.</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">How do guests get through the gate?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">By a guard with a guest list, a call box at the gate, or a code from the owner. When you tour homes with us, we set up the visit with the gate before we go.</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">Is there a gated community in Surfside Beach?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">No, not inside the town. Prestwick, about a mile outside it, is the gated neighborhood on this page nearest Surfside Beach.</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">Are there 55+ gated communities near Myrtle Beach?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Yes. Seasons at Prince Creek West in Murrells Inlet is the 55+ community on this page, and visitors use a call box at its main entrance.</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">Are there gated golf communities near Myrtle Beach?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Yes. Most of the places on this page are golf communities, from Tidewater in North Myrtle Beach to DeBordieu Colony.</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">Is Barefoot Resort a gated community?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Only in part. Barefoot Resort in North Myrtle Beach is mostly open, with a few gated neighborhoods inside it.</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">Is Grande Dunes a gated community?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Only in part. Grande Dunes in Myrtle Beach is a large planned community, and only some of its sections have gates.</p><p style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;max-width:760px;margin-top:1.6rem"><strong style="color:var(--navy)">Sources:</strong> <a href="https://www.barefoothoa.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/DES_Rules_Regs_V3_Final.pdf" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dye Estates rules</a>, <a href="https://litchfieldbythesea.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LBTS-Guest-Orientation-Guide-2026-Long-Version.pdf" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Litchfield by the Sea guest guide</a>, <a href="https://www.debordieucolony.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Welcome-Packet-2026-Website.pdf" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DeBordieu owners' packet</a>, <a href="https://www.heritageplantation.com/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Heritage Plantation association</a>, <a href="https://sccm.scseagrant.org/safe-harbor-reserve-harbor-recertifies-as-a-s-c-clean-marina/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SC Clean Marina, Reserve Harbor</a>, <a href="https://www.wachesaw.com/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Wachesaw Plantation Club</a>. Also the associations' and clubs' own documents, county records and local news. Each price is the past year's middle sale, checked against the MLS and the county deed index, and Horry County prices leave out builder sales. A price from few sales is a rough guide, and drive times assume no traffic. Not legal advice.</p><div class="c3ph-credits"><div class="c3ph-h" id="photo-credits">Photo credits</div><div role="list" aria-labelledby="photo-credits"><div role="listitem">Tidewater Plantation from above, with its golf holes along the inlet labelled. U.S. government aerial photo, 2023, by the USDA Farm Service Agency, <a href="https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public domain</a>, via <a href="https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The National Map (USGS)</a>. Chapter3 Realty exported this view from the NAIP image se