k-a">Solve trash pickup</span><span class="ck-h">No curbside outside city limits. Three options; know yours.</span><span class="ck-d">Details</span></a><a href="#parking" class="ck-cell"><span class="ck-n">8</span><span class="ck-a">Get the parking decal</span><span class="ck-h">Free beach parking, city residents only.</span><span class="ck-d">Details</span></a><a href="#golfcart" class="ck-cell"><span class="ck-n">9</span><span class="ck-a">Golf cart permit</span><span class="ck-h">$5 at the DMV, good for five years.</span><span class="ck-d">Details</span></a><a href="#vote" class="ck-cell"><span class="ck-n">10</span><span class="ck-a">Register to vote, check your zones</span><span class="ck-h">30 days before an election. Flood and evacuation zones at the same time.</span><span class="ck-d">Details</span></a></div><style>.ck-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:1px;background:var(--rule);border:1px solid var(--rule);max-width:980px;margin-top:.4rem}.ck-cell{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.3rem;background:var(--ivory);padding:1.05rem 1.1rem;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s}.ck-cell:hover{background:var(--ivory-2)}.ck-cell:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--brass);outline-offset:-2px}.ck-n{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--brass);line-height:1}.ck-a{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.35}.ck-h{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}.ck-d{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass-ink);margin-top:auto;padding-top:.35rem}</style><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.4rem 0 .5rem">The three deadlines that cost money if you miss them</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">First, 45 days from the day you move to get a South Carolina driver&#39;s license and to register every vehicle you own. The DMV charges about $305 per car, and the county charges its annual vehicle tax before the DMV will hand you a plate. Second, the 4 percent legal residence application for your new home, which Horry County wants by May 31; without it your first property tax bill is calculated at the 6 percent second-home rate. Third, voter registration, which closes 30 days before any election.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px">One of our team moved here from Ohio three years ago, missed the 45 day license window, and did not learn about the free resident beach parking until his second year. This is the checklist he wishes someone had handed him.</p></div></section>
 
