yle="margin:0;color:var(--navy);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600">Want to see what your budget buys here before you decide?</p><div style="display:flex;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-brass" href="#lead-form">Show me homes</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="tel:+18543332135">Call 854.333.2135</a></div></div>
