/a>. Little River: <a href="https://www.myhorrynews.com/opinion/yes-president-george-washington-did-sleep-in-horry-county/article_2f0b6f46-1e58-11ed-97e3-9fb8590a30fd.html" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Washington</a>, <a href="https://littlerivershrimpfest.org/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ShrimpFest</a>, <a href="https://www.postandcourier.com/myrtle-beach/news/waties-island-state-park-myrtle-beach-sc/article_dabee2b9-aede-4253-84b1-fdec1edc667d.html" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Waties Island</a>, <a href="https://www.glendornoch.com/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Glen Dornoch</a>. Conway: <a href="https://scliving.coop/sc-life/sc-life-features/10-reasons-to/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">the oaks</a>, <a href="https://www.conwayriverfest.com/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Riverfest</a>, <a href="https://www.wmbfnews.com/2026/06/26/conway-riverfest-returns-46th-year-with-250th-celebration-twist/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Riverfest 2026</a>, <a href="https://www.conwaysc.gov/news_detail_T6_R746.php" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Halloween, SC</a>, <a href="https://www.conwaysc.gov/news_detail_T6_R665.php" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lake Busbee</a>. North Myrtle Beach: <a href="https://parks.nmb.us/385/Music-on-Main-Concert-Series" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Music on Main</a>, <a href="https://www.fatharolds.com/" style=