up" class="sr"><div role="row"><span role="columnheader">Kind of home, middle half</span><span role="columnheader">Typical fee a month</span></div></div><div role="rowgroup"><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">A house</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span class="f">the middle half pay $70 to $135</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.088" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$95</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">A townhouse</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span class="f">the middle half pay $190 to $425</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.268" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$290</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">A condo off the ocean</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span class="f">the middle half pay $410 to $685</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.476" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$515</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">A condo in an oceanfront tower</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span class="f">the middle half pay $750 to $1,185</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.87" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$940</span></span></div></div></div><figcaption>The middle monthly fee of homes for sale that list one, from our listings feed. Across all condos, it is about $650.</figcaption></figure><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Listings here give the fee by the month. Over a year, that is about $1,140 for a typical house and about $7,800 for a typical condo.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="what-fees-cover"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="What fees cover">What do HOA fees cover in Myrtle Beach?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">A house fee rarely includes anything inside the house. A condo fee includes far more.</p><figure class="c3-gchart c3-hoa-cov"><span class="cap">About how many of every 10 listings say the fee includes each item</span><table><caption class="sr">About how many of every 10 homes for sale with a fee say the fee includes each item, by kind of home</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col" class="it">The fee includes</th><th scope="col">Ocean­front tower</th><th scope="col">Condo off the ocean</th><th scope="col">Town­house</th><th scope="col">House</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row" class="it">Insurance</th><td><svg class="pie" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" fill="#efe7da" stroke="#c4783a" stroke-opacity=".55" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="5" fill="none" stroke="#c4783a" stroke-width="10" stroke-dasharray="25.76 31.42" transform="rotate(-90 10 10)"/></svg><span class="v">8</span></td><td><svg class="pie" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" fill="#efe7da" stroke="#c4783a" stroke-opacity=".55" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="5" fill="none" stroke="#c4783a" stroke-width="10" stroke-dasharray="24.19 31.42" transform="rotate(-90 10 10)"/></svg><span class="v">8</span></td><td><svg class="pie" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" fill="#efe7da" stroke="#c4783a" stroke-opacity=".55" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="5" fill="none" stroke="#c4783a" stroke-width="10" stroke-dasharray="11.62 31.42" transform="rotate(-90 10 10)"/></svg><span class="v">4</span></td><td><svg class="pie" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><cir