 y="214.12719253333336" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1c2028">November 2011: $158,238</text><circle cx="570.8187919463087" cy="51.63946380000001" r="4.5" fill="#1c2028" stroke="#f4efe8" stroke-width="2"><title>May 2024: $350,036</title></circle><text x="562.8187919463087" y="43.63946380000001" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="end" fill="#1c2028">May 2024: $350,036</text><circle cx="624" cy="59.39756166666667" r="4.5" fill="#1c2028" stroke="#f4efe8" stroke-width="2"><title>September 2026: $339,738</title></circle><text x="616" y="77.39756166666666" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="end" fill="#1c2028">September 2026: $339,738</text></svg></div><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The peak was March 2007 at $240,280. The low was November 2011 at $158,238, a fall of 34.1 percent over 56 months. The index did not pass the 2007 peak again until December 2020, 165 months later. A buyer at the top who sold before then sold below the purchase price, before any selling cost.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The fastest rise was June 2021 to June 2022, 27.4 percent in twelve months. The value has been flat since: May 2024 was the high at $350,036, and September 2026 is 2.9 percent below it.</p><div style="overflow-x:auto;margin:1.2rem 0;max-width:760px"><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.92rem"><thead><tr><th style="padding:.55rem .8rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--navy);color:var(--navy);text-align:left;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase">Bought in September</th><th style="padding:.55rem .8rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--navy);color:var(--navy);text-align:left;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase">Typical value then</th><th style="padding:.55rem .8rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--navy);color:var(-