+<p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:0">That fits self-employed buyers and investors building a portfolio. The loan can also <a href="/invest/llc/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">close in an LLC</a>, a company you own that holds the property, which keeps a portfolio tidy. These loans are for property you rent out, not property you live in. A DSCR loan also fits <a href="/invest/strategies/small-multifamily/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">a duplex or fourplex you buy only to rent</a>. If you plan to use the place yourself for more than two weeks a year, tell your lender early, because that changes which loans you qualify for.</p>
