-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:2rem">Myrtle Beach's market has specific mechanics most sellers discover too late. These answers cover what you'll need to know before you list.</p>
+<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:2rem">Myrtle Beach's market has specific mechanics most sellers discover too late. These answers cover what you'll need to know before you list. More answers are in our <a href="/guides/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Myrtle Beach real estate guides, tools and reports</a>.</p>
