="display:none;margin-bottom:1rem"><label style="display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.4rem;font-weight:600">HOA transfer and document fees ($, estimate)</label><input class="idx-input" id="nsHoa" type="number" value="300" oninput="nsCalc()" style="max-width:240px"></div><label style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 1rem;cursor:pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="nsOOS" style="accent-color:var(--brass);width:15px;height:15px" onchange="nsCalc()"> I live outside South Carolina</label><div style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:1rem;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--navy);display:grid;gap:.35rem"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>Commission</span><strong id="nsCommOut">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>Deed stamps ($1.85 per $500, calculated for you)</span><strong id="nsStamps">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>Attorney, title, HOA, credits</span><strong id="nsOther">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span>Total selling costs</span><strong id="nsCosts">$0</strong></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:.6rem;font-size:1.05rem"><span><strong>Estimated net to you</strong></span><strong id="nsNet" style="color:var(--brass)">$0</strong></div><p id="nsI290" style="display:none;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;margin:.4rem 0 0">Because you live outside South Carolina, the closing attorney also withholds part of your gain for the state under form I-290. It is a prepayment of tax, not an extra tax. Details on the <a href="/sell/capital-gains/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">capital gains page</a>.</p></div><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:.9rem;line-height:1.5">Estimates for planning. Commission varies by listing. Deed stamps are calculated automatically at $1.85 per $500 of price. Attorney, title, and closing fees vary by firm. Property taxes get prorated to your closing date at closing. For exact numbers, ask us for a free seller net sheet.</p></div><script>
