coration:none"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--navy)">Murrells Inlet</div><div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-top:.35rem">Marshwalk proximity, LTR strength, growing mid-term rental demand.</div></a><a href="/submarkets/pawleys-island/" class="chooser-card" style="display:block;padding:1.5rem 1.75rem;border:1px solid var(--rule);margin-bottom:1rem;text-decoration:none"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--navy)">Pawleys Island</div><div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-top:.35rem">Luxury STRs, historic rentals, higher-AUM clientele.</div></a><a href="/submarkets/little-river/" class="chooser-card" style="display:block;padding:1.5rem 1.75rem;border:1px solid var(--rule);margin-bottom:1rem;text-decoration:none"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--navy)">Little River</div><div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-top:.35rem">Emerging value market: NC border, workforce LTR demand, lower entry prices.</div></a><a href="/submarkets/conway/" class="chooser-card" style="display:block;padding:1.5rem 1.75rem;border:1px solid var(--rule);margin-bottom:1rem;text-decoration:none"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--navy)">Conway</div><div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-top:.35rem">CCU student housing, LTR cash flow, lowest entry prices on the Grand Strand.</div></a></div></div>
 
