style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Tell us your boat and your budget.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">We will send the Little River houses, deeded slips and condos that fit, and check the flood map, the slip and the HOA rules for each one.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/?place=Little%20River">Ask about Little River homes</a></div></section></main>
+</style><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Little River sits on the Intracoastal Waterway, the boat channel behind the Grand Strand's beaches. The old village meets the water at the end of Mineola Avenue, with docks, boats and restaurants on the water, about a minute from US 17.</p><style>.c3ph-f{position:relative;margin:0;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ivory-2)}.c3ph-f img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:cover}.c3ph-cr{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;max-width:100%;padding:1.6rem .6rem .35rem 2.6rem;font:400 .625rem/1.3 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.01em;color:#fff;text-align:right;background:radial-gradient(farthest-side at 100% 100%,rgba(28,32,40,.72),rgba(28,32,40,.4) 55%,rgba(28,32,40,0));white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;pointer-events:none}.c3ph-cr a{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);text-underline-offset:2px;pointer-events:auto;padding:10px 0 6px}.c3ph-hero{margin:1.6rem 0 2rem}.c3ph-hero .c3ph-f{border-radius:8px}.c3ph-hero img{aspect-ratio:4/3}@media (min-width:700px){.c3ph-hero img{aspect-ratio:16/9}}.c3ph-hero figcaption{color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.5;margin-top:.55rem}</style><figure class="c3ph-hero" style="margin:1.6rem 0 1.8rem;max-width:640px;"><div class="c3ph-f"><img src="/images/2026-11-a/submarkets-little-river/little-river-waterfront-from-above-1200w.webp" srcset="/images/2026-11-a/submarkets-little-river/little-river-waterfront-from-above-600w.webp 600w, /images/2026-11-a/submarkets-little-river/little-river-waterfront-from-above-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 640px" width="1200" height="900" alt="The Intracoastal Waterway at Little River from above: a slip basin full of boats ringed by condo buildings, labelled Mariner's Pointe, and docks with boats at the end of a street, labelled Waterfront" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="c3ph-cr"><a href="https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="U.S. government aerial photo. License: Public domain" title="License: Public domain">U.S. government aerial photo</a></span></div><figcaption>The waterfront at the end of Mineola Avenue, and the slip basin at Mariner's Pointe, from above (NAIP aerial, 2023).</figcaption></figure><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Each May, on the weekend after Mother's Day, the Blue Crab Festival fills that waterfront with seafood from local restaurants, live music and crafters. It has been held for more than 40 years, and a water taxi brings people in from the water.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The beach at Cherry Grove Pier in North Myrtle Beach, Calabash in North Carolina and McLeod Seacoast hospital are all within about 11 minutes by car, as the map shows. The airport is the long drive, about 41 minutes.</p><figure class="c3-lr-fig" style="max-width:560px"><div class="c3-lr-frame"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" id="c3r-little-river" viewBox="0 0 360 288" width="360" height="288" role="img" aria-label="Map of Little River and the coast: from the old village, the beach at Cherry Grove Pier is about 11 minutes by car, Calabash, North Carolina, about 7 minutes, McLeod Seacoast hospital about 6 minutes and Barefoot Landing about 18 minutes." style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:760px;background:#f7f3ec;border:1px solid rgba(28,32,40,.15)"><style>#c3r-little-river text{font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#f7f3ec;stroke-width:3px;stroke-linejoin:round;fill:#1c2028}#c3r-little-river .h{font:500 17px 'Fraunces',Georgia,serif}#c3r-little-river .l{font-size:14px;font-weight:500}#c3r-little-river .m{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;fill:#91592b}#c3r-little-river .t{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;let