lined, is a separate town between Crescent Beach and Windy Hill","caption":"Atlantic Beach, outlined, is a separate town between Crescent Beach and Windy Hill, from US 17 to the ocean (2023 aerial).","description":"From above: a small town outlined in brass and labelled Atlantic Beach, running from the highway to the ocean, with streets labelled Crescent Beach on one side and Windy Hill on the other","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP"},"creditText":"USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP, public domain, via USGS The National Map","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP)","license":"https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/","acquireLicensePage":"https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer","isBasedOn":"https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place","name":"Crescent Beach, Atlantic Beach and Windy Hill, North Myrtle Beach, South Carolina"},"representativeOfPage":true},{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/submarkets-north-myrtle-beach/windy-hill-from-above-1200w.webp","url":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/submarkets-north-myrtle-beach/windy-hill-from-above-1200w.webp","width":1200,"height":857,"encodingFormat":"image/webp","name":"From above: streets of houses among trees labelled Windy Hill, a row of condo buildings along the beach, and the Atlantic Ocean","caption":"Windy Hill from above, 2023 aerial: streets of houses under the trees, condo buildings along the ocean, and a marsh creek at the left.","description":"From above: streets of houses among trees labelled Windy Hill, a row of condo buildings along the beach, and the Atlantic Ocean","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP"},"creditText":"USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP, public domain, via USGS The National Map","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (USDA Far