"@type":"Organization","name":"USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP"},"creditText":"USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP, public domain, via USGS The National Map","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP)","license":"https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/","acquireLicensePage":"https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer","isBasedOn":"https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place","name":"Windy Hill, North Myrtle Beach, South Carolina"},"representativeOfPage":true},{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/submarkets-north-myrtle-beach/west-of-us-17-new-streets-from-above-1200w.webp","url":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/submarkets-north-myrtle-beach/west-of-us-17-new-streets-from-above-1200w.webp","width":1200,"height":857,"encodingFormat":"image/webp","name":"From above: new streets and ponds cleared for houses labelled West of US 17, ball fields labelled Central Park, and the highway labelled US 17","caption":"West of US 17 from above, 2023 aerial: new streets cleared for houses, Central Park's ball fields, and US 17.","description":"From above: new streets and ponds cleared for houses labelled West of US 17, ball fields labelled Central Park, and the highway labelled US 17","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP"},"creditText":"USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP, public domain, via USGS The National Map","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (USDA Farm Service Agency, NAIP)","license":"https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/","acquireLicensePage":"https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer","isBasedOn":"https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place","name":"West of US 17, Central Park, North Myrtle Beach, South Carolina"},"representativeOfPag