+<h2>A Message from the Horry County Treasurer</h2>
+<p>Thank you for allowing me the opportunity to serve as your Horry County Treasurer.  As your Treasurer, customer service, oversight, and fiscal management are among my top priorities. We have assembled a devoted team of professionals, who will work diligently to increase communication with the people of Horry County, while also enhancing accessibility and responsiveness at your Treasurer's Office. </p>
+<p>If we can ever be of assistance, please do not hesitate to contact us. We are here for you! We look forward to serving the citizens of Horry County and making your Treasurer's Office work better for you.</p>
+<div class="author"><img src="https://www.horrycountysc.gov/media/zacgnhsy/angie-jone-thumbnail.png" alt=""><span class="name">Angie Jones</span></div>
