+			<td colspan="5" style>some of your gain isn’t excludable, and you may owe tax on it. See <a class="xmlbc-link" href="#en_US_2025_publink100011873" id="en_US_2025_publink1000139776" title="Reporting Your Home Sale"><span class="emphasis"><em>Reporting Your Home Sale</em></span></a> for instructions on how to report the gain on your tax return.</td>
+		</tr>
+	</tbody>
+</table>
+</div>
+
+<p></p>
